# .gitignore — MailGuard / Cargo360
#
# REGULA: in repo intra DOAR cod. Niciodata secrete, baza de date sau
# documentele clientilor. O scurgere e ireversibila — rescrierea istoricului
# nu sterge ce a fost deja clonat sau indexat.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SECRETE — chei API (OpenAI/Anthropic), credentiale DB, cheie IRIS SSO, CTS token.
# Doua locatii reale: radacina si app/.env (ambele citite de aplicatie).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
app/.env
app/.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
*credential*.json
# deploy key generata pe server (partea privata NU pleaca de acolo)
deploy/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# BAZA DE DATE si dump-uri — date reale (emailuri, clienti, angajati).
# DB-ul ruleaza in containerul mailguard-db, nu in arbore; dar dump-urile ajung aici.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.dump
*.sql.gz
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
backups/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DATE DE CLIENT — 114 MB de PDF/JPEG reale (facturi, scanuri, documente).
# storage/backups e symlink spre /home/mail-data — iese complet din arbore.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/doc_templates/
storage/
attachments/
uploads/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ARTEFACTE REPRODUCTIBILE
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
venv/
env/
.venv/
.pgdata/
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LOGURI — 684 MB pe server; contin adrese de email si continut de mesaje.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
logs/
*.log
*.log.*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# BACKUP-URI MANUALE — ~90 fisiere, 65 MB (40+ copii de mg-app.js).
# Git face istoricul; copiile cu timestamp devin zgomot.
# Atentie la variantele de sufix: _  .  -  si LIPIT (toate patru au fost folosite;
# ex. mg-app.js.bak20260722_v3 scapa de *.bak-* si de *.bak_*).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.bak
*.bak*
*.backup
*.backup-*
*.backup_*
*.orig
*.rej
*~

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SPECIFIC MEDIULUI DE LUCRU IRIS — nu apartin aplicatiei.
# Intr-un clone curat ar induce in eroare (deploy.sh face rsync din workspace-ul
# IRIS, nu pull din Git).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
deploy.sh
deploy_vendor.sh
deploy_changelog.sh
deploy_t4.sh
.iris_remote_fingerprint*
.iris_last_sync
.design_lint_baseline*
OUTBOX_*
CLAUDE-HISTORY.md
.claude/
.lint/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SCRIPTURI TEMPORARE de investigatie (au ramas in arbore din sesiuni vechi)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
sim20.py
sim_topup.py
tmp_*.py

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SISTEM / EDITOR
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
